	(text "Stitching Via Distance\n\nL=wavelength/20\n\nfor 915MHz on an outer layer:\nL = 9mm\n\nResonant Frequencies at 1.38GHz and 2.74GHz\nL = 2.5mm works best to suppress resonant frequencies,\nwhich would pass through a 9mm stitching distance"
